    "input": "Native CUA only",
    "observation": "Passive Playwright DOM and CDP AX tree",
    "renderer": "Production renderer/preload",
    "main": "Copied instrumented main/storage; disposable safeStorage; muted media; preparation scheduler stopped",
    "catalog": "Localhost 5191; 40 songs, 12 albums. Startup label incorrectly still says 20000/2000.",
    "recovery": "IPC gate substitutes recovery phase/held retry responses. This proves presentation and focus, not actual storage repair. Polling may overwrite a held retry with the substituted unavailable phase; those snapshots do not establish production status consistency."
