  "phases": {
    "before": "Current base source; route action retains focus on old Open News settings button; passive-ready and Dismiss remove focused notice leaving body. Baseline bundle hash not retained.",
    "final-chooser and final-music": "Notice fix plus initial startup-main destination. No subsequent notice/connection code change. Includes passive/Dismiss, Tab takeover, music heading and settings panel. Intermediate renderer bundle hash not retained.",
    "final-startup": "Rejected main target at full viewport: computed solid outline lies outside window and native screenshot shows no visible ring. Not accepted as visible-focus evidence.",
    "final-startup-heading": "Final build changes only startup destination from main to existing wordmark h1. Native AX, screenshot and next Tab verify visible heading focus and connection Retry. No claim that every earlier case was rerun on this bundle."
  },
